5.4 Final Summary of Specifications
This technical specification provides a comprehensive guide to the architecture, database schemas, REST API contracts, 2D/3D spatial geometry, and knowledge base subsystem. The server side of the VEO360 platform is fully prepared for industrial implementation, integration testing, and deployment within the target digital twin.


